{"parse": {"title": "THH-20", "pageid": 64957, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/THH-19\" title=\"THH-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">THH-20</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">THH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">20</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.BE.80.E6.97.A5.E4.B8.8D.E5.86.8D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"往日不再\">往日不再</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 往日不再</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Gone Are the Old Days</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>孩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>发<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>哭<span class=\"color-value\"></span>声<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>就<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>温<span class=\"color-value\"></span>暖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2110120</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那摊血迹依旧沉默地卧在走廊的中心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>……噢，看来我不在的时候，这儿发生了许多故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在思考之后，她拨通了手中的电话。<br />一阵等候音之后，电话被接通了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-625513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-625513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-625513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>……淑女格蕾丝，你终于联系我了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-625510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-625510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-625510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>我被发现了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不出意料地，电话彼端传来了躁动不安的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>金伯利，你可以告诉我旅馆里到底发生了什么吗？为什么走廊里会有一摊血迹和少许的脑浆，谁死在了这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-625511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-625511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-625511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>……是那个芝诺人，他发疯了，对着自己的太阳穴来了一枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625516.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625516.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>他虽然死了，但我还没来得及销毁他床底下的术阵……我也还没来得及找到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女轻轻地叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>据点暴露了，我们得带走所有有关于“仪式”的东西，离开这个地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>基金会的人在不久之后就会对这里进行全面的搜查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>——我可不想和那些灰白格子打交道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话彼端传来了短暂的沉默，这不常见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625516.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625516.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>不过……您能告诉我，维尔汀是一个怎样的人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话对面，她的语气有些惴惴不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625516.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625516.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-625516.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625516.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>我不小心让她知道了一个大秘密——她的记忆力好吗？会把一件事记很久吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>不用那么忧虑，金伯利。人很少会关心自己以外的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女露出了淡淡的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……但我很期待与她的下一次见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:122%\">数日后。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>蓝手帕小姐，无需担忧，您大可把这次对谈看作是一次普通的对话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……我是在一个荒原中拾到它的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>它是指那个具备神秘学力量的“旅馆”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>和您确认一下，这个神秘学意识的本体，就是您襁褓中所包裹的……形似心脏的胚胎，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>它的智力约等于一岁的婴儿，并不具备策划和实施这种行为的能力——而它视您为母亲，对您有着异乎寻常的信任与依赖……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>……我们认为您也参与了这些行动。或者说，您才是那个幕后的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>也许您并不具备主观上的恶性，但事实如此，因为您而精神崩溃的人在镇子上比比皆是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>……所以，他们会寻求一些精神上的解脱——正是因为这个原因，重塑之手对这个镇子进行了史无前例的渗透。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>我说得对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>噢……我从来没去过那个镇子，不知道那儿的情况……但如果真如您所说的那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这也是他们自己的选择，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>……明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙沙的声音响起，职员在笔录上记载了关键的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>在不久之前，司辰向基金会提交了另一个关键信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>在您的旅馆中，是否有自称隶属于“启明会”的信徒活动？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>噢……是的，他们离开得不久，我还能记住他们的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>他们做了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>他们在地板上乱涂乱画，发出些奇怪的声音……噢，我想起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>他们似乎想要尝试什么东西……只是这种尝试并未成功，反而闹出了不少笑话——有一个可怜的女孩被他们关入了镜子里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>她从未放弃过逃生的尝试。一到深夜，那扇镜子就会发出“砰砰”的响声……哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>……我们在搜查旅馆的时候，并未发现任何被困在镜子里的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>噢，那就是……可惜了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生神色平静，一如往昔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>既然您知道他们是具有危险性的神秘学家团体，为何不及时向基金会申报呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这与我有什么关系……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生舔了舔略有干裂的嘴唇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我并不会感到害怕。不如说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我一直在期待着这一天。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "THH-20"}}